        "In this example, all the dependencies needed by gsftp are (recursively) supplied in the vendor directory,",
        "so “go install” does not read any source files outside the gsftp Git checkout.",
        "Therefore the gsftp build is reproducible given only the content of the gsftp Git repo and not any other code.",
        "And the dependencies need not be edited when copying them into the gsftp repo.",
        "And potential users can run “go get github.com/constabulary/example-gsftp/cmd/gsftp” without needing to have an additional vendoring tool installed or special GOPATH configuration."
